Inherited notices

This plugin is derived from "projectstreeview" by Paul Kertscher
(http://sourceforge.net/p/projectstreeview/code/HEAD/tree/trunk/, version
0.0.3-78), later adapted for newer Redmine versions by Thomas Koch
(https://github.com/braini75/projects_treeview).

The original CSS tree menu was based on work by Ryan Seddon
(http://www.thecssninja.com/css/css-tree-menu). Since version 0.5.0 the tree is
built on <details>/<summary> and that CSS is no longer used; the notice is kept
because earlier versions of this repository still contain it.
